; ---------------------------------------------------------
; VNKit demo script — mechanics tour
;   * backgrounds / characters / music / sfx
;   * choices, variables, conditional branching
;   * MINI-GAME:  @minigame Lockpick → result in $lockResult
;   * EVENT CGs:  @cg — unlocked in the CG gallery (Title → Gallery).
;     RooftopSunset is guaranteed, RooftopNight only on the good end:
;     replaying with different choices is what fills the gallery.
;   * SPINE: add an entry under Spine Characters / Spine CGs on the
;     engine and every "appearance" below becomes an ANIMATION name
;     (Ayame.Smile: plays the "Smile" animation; a CG listed in
;     Spine CGs plays animated instead of static). Without Spine
;     the same names resolve as sprites / placeholders.
; Enable "Use Placeholder Graphics" to run this without any art.
; ---------------------------------------------------------

# Start

@bg Campus time:0.8
@bgm ThemeDay fade:1.5
@set affection=0, lockResult=0

A warm spring afternoon. The school day is finally over.

@char Ayame.Idle pos:center time:0.5
Ayame: Hey, you actually came! [br]I wasn't sure you would.

; Emotion switch: with a Spine entry for "Ayame" this plays the
; "Smile" ANIMATION mid-scene; with sprites it swaps the sprite.
Ayame.Smile: The view from the rooftop is amazing at this hour.

@char Ayame pos:left time:0.5
@char Rin.Idle pos:right time:0.5
Rin: Oh. You brought someone along.
@sfx Chime

Ayame.Smile: This is the transfer student I told you about.

@choice "Greet Rin warmly" goto:Warm do:affection+=1 | "Nod quietly" goto:Quiet | "Try the old locker" goto:Locker

# Warm
Rin.Smile: ...Hi. Nice to meet you, I guess.
Ayame.Laugh: See? I told you she warms up fast.
@goto Park

# Quiet
Rin: Hm. The quiet type, huh.
Ayame: Give them a chance, Rin.
@goto Park

; ---------------------------------------------------------
; MINI-GAME — Skyrim-style lockpicking.
; The engine pauses the script, runs the mini-game and stores
; the outcome in $lockResult (1 = opened, 0 = failed).
; ---------------------------------------------------------
# Locker
Rin: That rusty locker? Be my guest.
@minigame Lockpick difficulty:1 picks:3 var:lockResult
@if lockResult==1 goto:LockerOpen else:LockerShut

# LockerOpen
@sfx Chime
@set affection+=1
Rin.Smile: Huh. It actually opened. Impressive.
Ayame.Laugh: Told you our new friend is full of surprises.
@goto Park

# LockerShut
Rin: Locked tight. Maybe next time.
Ayame.Shy: Don't worry about it. That lock is ancient anyway.
@goto Park

; ---------------------------------------------------------
# Park
@bg Rooftop time:1.2
@stopBgm fade:2

The three of you watch the clouds drift by.

; EVENT CG #1 — always shown, always unlocked in the gallery.
; Add "RooftopSunset" to Spine CGs on the engine to see it ANIMATED.
@cg RooftopSunset fade:1.2
A moment worth remembering.
@cg off fade:0.8

Ayame.Smile: Days like this make everything feel possible.

@if affection>0 goto:GoodEnd else:NormalEnd

; ---------------------------------------------------------
; Good end = a SECOND, missable CG. Save here, then rollback
; (mouse wheel up / PageUp) and pick other choices to compare.
# GoodEnd
@bgm ThemeSunset fade:1
Rin.Smile: You're alright. Come back tomorrow, okay?

; EVENT CG #2 — unlocked only on the good end.
@cg RooftopNight fade:1.2
The city lights flicker on, one by one.
@cg off fade:0.8
@goto Finale

# NormalEnd
Rin: ...See you around, I suppose.
@goto Finale

# Finale
@hideChars time:1.0
And so the day quietly came to an end.[br][br]<i>Gallery, saves, backlog, rollback — everything you just saw is already working. Thanks for trying VNKit!</i>
@goto Epilogue.Start
